        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(e) Any grievance involving assignment or reassignment of approved Job Titles shall, if presented within sixty (60) days after the date of the occurrence which gave rise to the grievance, be subject to the grievance provisions set forth in Article 7, but no grievance involving the Customer Operations Work Operation Codes and Skill Classification Plan or its administration shall be subject to the arbitration provisions of Article 8 of this Contract.",
